meta {
  name: 03. Read subscription-billing flags
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/subscription-billing
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{subRevampAdminToken}}
}

assert {
  res.body.statusCode: isDefined
}

docs {
  Record this before changing anything. On 2026-11-04 the namespace did not exist on staging
  (statusCode 404), i.e. every flag was at its code default (lineItemMaths off, lineItemWrites on,
  the rest off). `PUT /api/v1/config/{namespace}` REPLACES the whole namespace config, so the
  enable and restore bodies below carry every key.
}
